### SOMS business-code segment regression script (VS Code REST Client)
### Business codes segmented by domain (see src/common/business-code.ts): 0 success / 10xxx general / 20xxx friend / 30xxx message / 40xxx group
### Principle: business results always return HTTP 200 + code; only 401/404/409/500 keep HTTP codes for the system layer.

@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token =


### Swagger docs (open /api/v1/docs in a browser)
GET {{host}}/docs


### 1. register missing password → expect HTTP 200 / code 10000 (ValidationPipe folded into the business flow)
POST {{host}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "test"}


### 2. register a new user → expect HTTP 200 / code 0
POST {{host}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "demo_1234", "password": "123456"}


### 3. duplicate register → expect HTTP 200 / code 10002 (ALREADY_EXISTS)
POST {{host}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "demo_1234", "password": "123456"}


### 4. login wrong password → expect HTTP 200 / code 10003 (UNAUTHENTICATED)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Authorization: public
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "no_such_user", "password": "wrongpwd"}


### 5. access a protected route with no token → expect HTTP 401 / code 10003 (JwtAuthGuard, HTTP code retained)
POST {{host}}/user/my-profile


### 6. renew-access with an invalid refresh → expect HTTP 200 / code 10003
POST {{host}}/auth/renew-access
Authorization: public
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken": "invalid_token"}


### Log in to get a token (fill data.access_token from the response into @token above before running the cases below)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Authorization: public
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "demo_1234", "password": "123456"}


### 7. by-uniq-name not found → expect HTTP 200 / code 10001 (NOT_FOUND)
POST {{host}}/user/by-uniq-name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"account": "no_such_user"}


### 8. send-friend-request to self → expect HTTP 200 / code 20001 (FRIEND_SELF)
###    replace userId with your own id (get it from my-profile first)
POST {{host}}/user/send-friend-request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": 10}
